#Packet Tracer Lab - Switch and Router Connectivity

**Date:** October, 2026
**Security Domain:** Network Infrastructure
**Tools & Hardware Used:** Cisco Packet Tracer 

---

## 1. Scenario & Objective
Use Packet Tracer and knowledge of Network Infrastructure to check and create connectivity between 3 PCs and 
a newly placed Switch & Router. Ensure that the PCs can ping each other, the intermediary devices and the Internet.

